 "what_this_measures": "Whether the trajectory the gain is read from depends on the grid. The gain is a ratio of two amplitudes, so if the inner mass stock agrees between two resolutions at every matched station, the gain agrees and the question of whether the saturation is a grid artefact is settled for these runs.",
